    "CONTENT: this PDF is not an LBP Form 2 per-office report. PDF pages 1 to 5 are the Sangguniang Panlungsod excerpt of minutes (15th Regular Session, November 9, 2022), Resolution No. 16-0673-2022 enacting Ordinance No. 16-053-2022, the CY 2023 appropriation ordinance (Section 1 totals by fund, Section 2 Sources of Funds, Section 3 Use of Funds, Sections 4 to 6). Enacted November 9, 2022; approved (stamped date) December 05, 2022. PDF pages 6 to 13 are the City Mayor's Budget Message dated October 13, 2022 with Exhibits 1 to 5 and the hospital and market summaries. The pages carry no \"Page X of Y\" numbering (the ordinance pages are numbered \"Cont'd: -2-\" to \"-5-\").",
    "summary.offices is empty because the document has no per-office figures (those are in 2023-annual-annual-budget-lep, -hospitals and -market-slaughterhouse). summary.funds gives the Section 3 Use of Funds class totals per fund; \"otherPurposes\" for the General Fund (461,333,637.00) is the sum of the five printed Other Purposes lines (LDRRMF, Development Project, Aid to Barangays, Debt Servicing, Lump-Sum for Retirement) and is not itself printed in the Section 3 table, though the Budget Message text states P461,333,637. summary.totalAppropriations (3,137,272,115.00) is the sum of the three fund totals printed in Section 1; the ordinance does not print this grand total.",
    "Section 3 prints Development Project as \"289,054,304,00\" (comma for decimal point); transcribed as 289,054,304.00.",
    "Exhibit 3 prints Social Services 846,606,786.00 and Total 2,871,781,516.00; the items do sum to the printed 2,871,781,516.00, but every other schedule (Exhibit 4 2023 column, the Budget Message text \"P846,606,788\", and the ordinance total 2,871,781,518.00) uses 846,606,788.00. Transcribed as printed.",
    "Exhibit 1 (pie chart of the 2023 expenditure program, slice labels 46.818%, 29.480%, 7.638%, 5.000%, 10.065%, 0.722%, 0.025%, 0.252%) and the Exhibit 2 and 4 charts duplicate the tables and were not transcribed separately. The narrative Goals and Objectives, Fiscal Policies and Program Thrusts pages were not transcribed.",
